<view class="page" wx:if="{{order}}">
  <view class="card">
    <text class="title ellipsis">{{order.taskTitle}}</text>
    <view class="row mt8" style="gap:12rpx;">
      <text class="tag tag-plain">{{order.no}}</text>
      <text class="tag tag-plain">应结总额 {{order.totalText}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-item">
    <view class="form-label required">申报类型</view>
    <view class="row" style="gap:16rpx;">
      <view class="type-btn {{type === 'pay' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-type="pay" bindtap="switchType">
        付款申报（需求方）
      </view>
      <view class="type-btn {{type === 'receive' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-type="receive" bindtap="switchType">
        收款申报（承接方）
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-item">
    <view class="form-label required">申报金额（元）</view>
    <input
      class="form-input amount-input"
      type="digit"
      value="{{amount}}"
      placeholder="请输入本次付款或收款金额"
      placeholder-class="placeholder"
      bindinput="onAmountInput"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="form-item">
    <view class="form-label required">申报说明</view>
    <textarea
      class="form-textarea"
      value="{{remark}}"
      maxlength="200"
      placeholder="如：首期款 50%，已于 10 月 20 日银行转账，附回单"
      placeholder-class="placeholder"
      bindinput="onRemarkInput"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="form-item">
    <view class="form-label">转账凭证</view>
    <view class="upload-grid">
      <view class="upload-item" wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="path">
        <image src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <view class="del" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeFile">×</view>
      </view>
      <view class="upload-add" bindtap="chooseFiles">
        <text class="plus">+</text>
        <text>上传凭证</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    平台仅记录双方申报与确认结果，不提供资金支付、托管或结算服务；请勿在说明中填写完整银行账号。
  </view>

  <view class="footer-holder"></view>
  <view class="footer-bar">
    <view class="btn btn-primary {{submitting ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
      {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交申报'}}
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
